  "note": "The dynamicanalysis image under gVisor via podman, as the analysis worker starts it: no extra environment (sandbox.SetEnv has no caller), root, online with private ranges and cloud metadata blocked. npm installs with `npm install <pkg>` after `npm init --force` in /app; PyPI with `python -m pip install --pre <pkg>` in the /app/.pyenv venv.",
